// The sound bank - Stage 2, Day 7.
// A small library of short sounds, each tagged so the page can pick the right ones for a roast:
//   SFX         effects and crowd reactions (gasp, splash, rimshot...), generated by scripts/make-sounds.mjs
//   VOICE_LINES one-word interjections ("Whoa!") spoken in a character's voice, by scripts/make-voice-lines.mjs
// pickPre / pickBed / pickSting choose the layers for one roast. Pure data and logic (no audio),
// so it is tested in Node. The mixer (mixer.js) plays what is picked.
//
// A roast is a small score:
//   t = 0          an opening sound starts the instant the roast is triggered (never delays anything)
//   t = ~300 ms    a one-word interjection from ANOTHER character joins in
//   when it ends   the opening layers fade out as the roast voice starts
//   under it       an optional quiet bed (crickets for a silence)
//   after the last word   a sting (rimshot, laugh, air horn...)

const ALL = ['gentle', 'spicy', 'savage'];
const TYPES = ['crash', 'scream', 'silence', 'lucky_win', 'rage_quit', 'panic', 'general'];

